== Notes ==

* An extra two rounds get added to the duration after accounting for [[extend spell]]. This makes the actual duration (in rounds) 5 + 1/level normally and 8 + 2/level extended.
* If a target is a [[player character]], the [[difficulty setting]] affects the actual duration for that target. Under the "easy" and "very easy" settings, the duration will be divided by 4; under "normal", it will be divided by 2.
* Due to a .2da bug, ''clarity'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

